UID:AGTX1n6dLc
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 124 mins (2h04m)\n\nOriginally released on June 20\,
  1975\, Jaws\, based on the best-selling novel by Peter Benchley\, became 
 the first true summer blockbuster and a cultural tsunami. Celebrate 50 yea
 rs of Jaws with this new 4K restoration\, with four screenings presented i
 n 3D. No OCAP for the 6:15pm 3D screening on August 31 3D screenings:Frida
 y\, August 29 - 3:00pmSaturday\, August 30 - 9:30pmSunday\, August 31 - 6:
 15pmMonday\, September 1 - 3:45pm Open Caption screenings:Sunday\, August 
 31 - 12:00pm\, 3:00pm\, 9:30pmTuesday\, September 2 - 3:45pm\, 7:00pm\n\nh
 ttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/jaws
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
